---
source: tests/planner_snapshots.rs
expression: rendered
---
initial local file
operations:
1. create remote file if still absent

initial remote file
operations:
1. install remote content locally

unchanged
no operation: local and remote content match

local edit
operations:
1. replace remote content if the expected revision still matches

remote edit
operations:
1. replace local content

explicit local deletion
operations:
1. delete remote file if the expected revision still matches

explicit remote deletion
operations:
1. delete local file

explicit local directory deletion
operations:
1. delete empty remote directory

explicit local directory deletion with Dropbox entries beneath
blocked: remote directory still holds entries

explicit remote directory deletion
operations:
1. delete empty local directory

inaccessible local state
blocked: local path is inaccessible

stale remote state
blocked: remote inventory is stale

simultaneous conflicting edits
conflict: local and remote payloads diverged; preserve both payloads
